 "rdfs:label": "local-ai-chat-frontend — GraphRAG ontology & call graph",
 "rdfs:comment": [
  "factual: This is a client-only React SPA with no backend and no MVC framework. There is no Controller layer; components in src/components/ChatAndSettings.tsx fuse Controller (fetch/state logic) and View (JSX) responsibilities. Mapped as lacf:Component with role annotations rather than separate lacf:Controller/lacf:View types.",
  "factual: 'Table' is IndexedDB object stores (lacf:Store), not a relational DB. 'Model' is TypeScript type definitions (lacf:TypeModel). 'API-provided functions' does not apply — this app is an API *consumer*, not provider; lacf:ExternalApi nodes record the LLM provider endpoints it calls instead.",
  "factual: No batch/scheduled job processing exists anywhere in this codebase (no cron, no queue, no tasks directory) — the BatchTask category is intentionally empty.",
  "unverified/speculative (recommendation 3/5): Feature groupings under lacf:UserFeature are derived from .claude/analyzed/use_cases.md's use-case diagram, not from explicit in-code feature-flag or module boundaries — treat as an interpretive grouping, not a literal source construct."
 ],
 "prov:wasDerivedFrom": "https://github.com/hidao80/local-ai-chat-frontend",
 "prov:generatedAtTime": "2026-07-20",
